{"id":"n62824-4-7","stage":2,"title":"놓치다 · 没赶上","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62824-4-7-1","ko":"저 버스가 막차인데 놓쳤으니 어떻게 하지?","zh":"那辆公交车是末班车，我错过了，现在该怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스가","audio":"/audio/4a5fae1e77392a579e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"막차인데","meaning":"末班车","explanation":"막차：末班车；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"막차","audio":"/audio/0baf27d179daa4e07338.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50034","senseId":"1","lemma":"막차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"막차인데","audio":"/audio/6ac99a1d5d0f2e7fb725.mp3"}},{"text":"놓쳤으니","meaning":"没赶上，错失","explanation":"놓치다：没赶上，错失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"놓치다","audio":"/audio/b974190e1a66b1c56553.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62824","senseId":"4","lemma":"놓치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓쳤으니","audio":"/audio/0054ffd9ea46405eb3c2.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"做、处理（어떻게 하다：怎么办）","explanation":"하다：做、处理（어떻게 하다：怎么办）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0baf27d179daa4e0","term":"막차","zh":"末班车","audio":"/audio/0baf27d179daa4e07338.mp3","entryId":"50034","definition":"当天的最后一班车。","pronunciation":["막차"]},{"id":"b974190e1a66b1c5","term":"놓치다","zh":"没赶上，错失","audio":"/audio/b974190e1a66b1c56553.mp3","entryId":"62824","definition":"未能坐上原打算要乘坐的交通工具。","pronunciation":["녿치다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、处理（어떻게 하다：怎么办）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、处理（어떻게 하다：怎么办）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2d7d3d2eb9e97c9774d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62824-4-7-2","ko":"택시를 타야지 뭐.","zh":"那就打车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"택시를","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"택시를","audio":"/audio/2fbdb0907659160b0c98.mp3"}},{"text":"타야지","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타야지","audio":"/audio/